# The public client id of Sovra's GitHub OAuth App, baked into local builds so
# Connect GitHub signs in on GitHub's page with no setup. Copy to
# github-client.env (gitignored) and fill in. Create the app at
# https://github.com/settings/applications/new (any homepage and callback URL),
# then tick "Enable Device Flow" on its page. Device flow needs no client secret.
# Without an id, Connect GitHub walks people through pasting a key instead.
# A build-time environment variable of the same name wins over this file.
SOVRA_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
